{"citations":[{"path":"docs/adr/0085-fsquint-single-owner-package-boundary.md","repository":"FS-GG/.github","revision":"54b948b07a5f15fd1078afbebe9174eff9a29b2c","sha256":"69b949110aace39ce9949b2d81505f7c5dd33813ce5c942cd78fe2cf0e7fae6b"},{"path":"src/FS.GG.SDD.Artifacts/TypedSpecifications/QuintReplay.fs","repository":"FS-GG/FS.GG.SDD","revision":"cec249fe6d4aa3dac1722999bb094fa3998ac70f","sha256":"fd7d330894e38d4c0b8976374515c3969696a206e9064b5a80b8ba44facf94ef"},{"path":"tests/FS.GG.Coordination.Orchestration.Host.Tests/ChoreoTrace.fs","repository":"FS-GG/FS.GG.Coordination","revision":"05e38c5be9b8f7edde87cd9b94974f10a63b759b","sha256":"0149aa353fa38477297a33ce267ff30b4412772dc2da5f575514cb0d800d7454"},{"path":"tests/FS.GG.Coordination.Orchestration.Host.Tests/packages.lock.json","repository":"FS-GG/FS.GG.Coordination","revision":"05e38c5be9b8f7edde87cd9b94974f10a63b759b","sha256":"ed3d7459209075a444e025a641309ab871935f303a577146a8f21d0b472b7e38"},{"path":"src/FS.GG.Coordination.Qualification.Contracts/Library.fs","repository":"FS-GG/FS.GG.Coordination","revision":"05e38c5be9b8f7edde87cd9b94974f10a63b759b","sha256":"733b2c50a831c65f99267ca83f88bd9240593bff5a80a80c0bf77ab812a7eb09"},{"path":"src/FS.GG.Coordination.Qualification.Contracts/packages.lock.json","repository":"FS-GG/FS.GG.Coordination","revision":"05e38c5be9b8f7edde87cd9b94974f10a63b759b","sha256":"897be382329f8106b698dcfcbbe6086d45eec00376a93fc9e8c229309900dc58"},{"path":"src/FS.GG.Coordination.Cli/packages.lock.json","repository":"FS-GG/FS.GG.Coordination","revision":"05e38c5be9b8f7edde87cd9b94974f10a63b759b","sha256":"2fc09ba4c95f3ade2ac45b14e61b97ce99d5680dca76d331165a4f4b5e069c96"}],"conflictsWith":[],"id":"platform/fsquint-owner","kind":"decision","recordedAt":"2026-10-14T12:01:06Z","repository":"FS-GG/.github","schema":"fsgg.atlas/1","status":"recorded","summary":"ADR-0085 assigns generic ITF decoding, replay and optional bounded Quint tooling to the independent FsQuint package owner. The inspected SDD compatibility facade delegates to FsQuint, and Coordination uses it in generic correspondence tests, including Host ChoreoTrace. Coordination production Qualification.Contracts instead retains a separately locked SDD.Artifacts Quint kernel; its CLI lock does not contain FsQuint. Generic ownership and scoped test adoption do not prove every production runtime has migrated. Package upgrades, CLI tool pins and installed runtime adoption are distinct contracts; organization board participation is not a prerequisite for generic consumers.","supersedes":["b262187aa66e8a97083bf7f79b91595bf7a4077abe7f8be5b00b4998f4579d20"],"tags":["decision","platform"],"title":"FsQuint owns generic correspondence once"}
